{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>iCaelum 是一款結合天氣預報、天文資訊與即時天體追蹤的應用程式，內建名為 Sentinel 的健康與安全監測工具，適合攝影師、航海人士、園藝愛好者以及經常外出的旅遊人士使用。應用提供多個預設設定檔，會按你的活動篩選最相關的數據。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多源天氣與天象資訊</h2>\n<p>應用可並列比較多個天氣來源的溫度、降雨、雲量與能見度預測；Sentinel 會持續監測空氣質素、紫外線、花粉與自然災害警報，並以顏色分級顯示風險。你亦可追蹤太陽與月亮的實時位置、日出日落與月相資訊，計算物件的影子長度與方向，並查看全球風場地圖及即時降雨雷達。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-9-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-10-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：iCaelum</li>\n<li>應用類別：Weather</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T19:39:59.157109+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}